@startuml feedback-sequence
title Wrong guess -> AI feedback
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor "Player (guesser)" as P
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "GameRoundChat\nActionHandler" as CH
participant "GameRoundFeedbackService" as RFS
participant "AiDispatcher\n(per game)" as D
participant "FeedbackService /\nAiFeedbackGenerator" as FG
participant "AiChatService" as AI
participant "AI provider" as LLM
participant "GameEventPublisher" as EP
participant "Round feedback session\n(in memory)" as RS

note over D
  Meanwhile, the host browser sends canvas snapshots to
  /app/game/draw/snapshot, analysed by AiDrawingAnalysisService.
  The latest drawing note is attached to each guess.
end note

P -> FE : types a guess in chat
FE -> CH : SEND /app/game/chat {text}
CH -> CH : guess handler marks it INCORRECT,\nsend as chat message
CH -> RFS : onGuess(round, player, guess, messageId)
RFS -> RS : addGuess(text, drawing note, time remaining fraction)
alt player's timing condition = INSTANT
  RFS -> D : launch(generate)
  D -> FG : generate(all guesses so far, word, framing, timing, previous facts)
  FG -> AI : stage 1 - fact generation
  AI -> LLM : chat completion
  LLM --> AI : neutral fact note
  FG -> AI : stage 2 - framing rewrite\n(CORRECTIVE, NEUTRAL or POSITIVE)
  AI -> LLM : chat completion
  LLM --> AI : framed text
  FG --> D : FeedbackGenerationResult (status, fact, framed, usage)
  D -> RFS : onResult
  RFS -> RS : record GeneratedFeedback + AI usage
  alt status = SUCCESS
    RFS -> EP : publishRoundFeedback(playerId, feedbackId, messageId, text)
    EP --> FE : /user/queue/game/round  FEEDBACK (this player only)
    FE -> P : feedback shown under the guess
  else FACT_FAILED or FRAMING_FAILED
    note right of RFS : kept for research, nothing sent to the player
  end
else DELAYED
  note right of RFS : guess is only accumulated, nothing generated now
end

== Delayed timing: end of the drawing phase ==
note over RFS
  GameRoundPhaseStateDrawingHandler.onExit calls generateDelayed(round).
  For each DELAYED player with at least one guess, the same two-stage
  generation runs once with all their guesses (messageId = null), and
  FEEDBACK is published to that player only.
end note
@enduml
